# Patterns here are relative to THIS directory. The first version of this file
# spelled them from the repository root ("notes/coverage/forge_roundtrip/*/out/")
# and therefore matched nothing, which is how a forge cache, the copied flat, a
# lib symlink and the per-run _gen scratch ended up committed.
*/out/
*/cache/
*/_gen/
*/lib/
*/src/
*/build.log
*/build2.log
*/test.log
*/coverage.log
